node_modules
dist
.env.local
*.local

# The repository root .gitignore is a Python template and contains a bare
# `lib/`, which matches at any depth and therefore swallows `src/lib/` — both
# from git and from Tailwind's class scanner, which reads .gitignore too. That
# is how `bg-slate-500` and `bg-amber-600` silently stopped being generated.
# A deeper .gitignore wins, so re-include the directory explicitly.
!src/lib/
